{"id":561,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"報恩感謝を礎に探究と選択を深める教育","feature_description":"茨城高等学校・中学校は、建学の精神「報恩感謝」を礎に、真理と正義、心身の強健、協同友愛を大切にする中高一貫校です。六年間を発達段階に応じた三期に分け、きめ細かな指導で個性と能力の伸長を支えます。探究的な思考を重んじる授業、希望制課外授業、学校行事や部活動を通して、自ら判断して選択し、社会に貢献するリーダーを育てます。医学・国際教養の専門コースも設けています。","clubs":[{"id":10613,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10614,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10615,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10616,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10617,"name":"男子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10618,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10619,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10620,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10621,"name":"男子ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10622,"name":"女子ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10623,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10624,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ibaraki-jsh.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10625,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https:/